+## Discounts
+
+- A discount is a percentage from 0 to 100, applied to the whole invoice, not per line.
+- The discounted total is rounded to whole cents once, at the end; halves round up
+  (0.625 becomes 0.63), which is what accounting expects.
+- Line amounts in the CSV export are rounded to cents the same way.
